Package: explo
Type: Package
Title: Quick Descriptive Summaries for Labelled Survey Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Joe", "Crowley", email = "joeac121@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A personal collection of helper functions for producing quick
    descriptive summaries -- crosstabs, missing-data reports, numeric
    summaries, and predictor-level breakdowns -- from labelled survey data
    imported via haven/labelled. Ported from the deprecated 'quackery'
    scratch project as a pilot for converting exploratory Quarto notebooks
    into a maintained package, documented separately in an accompanying
    Quarto site rather than in the function-defining notebooks themselves.
